natural_abilities:
  - name: "Robot body (M.D.C. by location)"
    description: "The Improved Shemarrian (introduced 105 P.A.): * Rail Gun (1) 70; * Antennae (2) 10 each; * Hands (2) 18 each; Upper Arms and Shoulders (2) 100 each; Forearms (2, plated) 80 each; Legs (2) 130 each; * Head 90; Protective Armored Headdress 75; ** Main Body 400 in armor, 250 without armor (rare). * A small, difficult target needing a Called Shot, and even then the attacker is -3 to strike (antennae -4). Destroying the head eliminates all optics and sensors, but the robot keeps fighting blindly with no combat bonuses to strike, parry or dodge; damage comes off the headdress first. ** Depleting the main body destroys the robot (see Self-Destruct Program)."
  - name: "Robot P.S. 36 damage"
    description: "Restrained punch 1D4 M.D.; full strength punch 2D6 M.D.; power punch 4D6 M.D. (counts as two melee attacks); full strength claw strike 3D6 M.D.; power claw strike 6D6 M.D. (two attacks); head butt 1D4 M.D.; or by weapon."
  - name: "Running"
    description: "90 mph (144 km) maximum. Running does not tire the robot and the speed can be kept up indefinitely."
  - name: "Leaping"
    description: "Leaps about 20 feet (6 m) high or lengthwise; a running leap above 40 mph (64 km) adds 10 feet (3 m)."
  - name: "Looks completely alive"
    description: "Realistic fake skin and hair. Her size keeps her out of human-sized armor and clothing other than capes and cloaks; Archie made Shemarrian armor in several cosmetic styles, and 95% of encounters find them in their traditional armor."
  - name: "Bionic body"
    description: "Half the Shemarrian is bionic: bionic limbs, reinforced spine and shoulders, and bionic armor (see M.D.C. by location)."
  - name: "Hand Claws and Laser"
    description: "Protective gauntlets on the hands and forearms each house a laser, fired by pointing the wrist and an internal command, and the fingers have retractable claws. Laser: 3D6 M.D. per blast, each blast one melee attack, no simultaneous blasts, range 2000 feet (610 m), payload effectively unlimited. Claws: 3D6 per attack, each one melee attack."
  - name: "Robotic features"
    description: "All the standard features of an Archie ''Bot, plus passive light amplification (nightvision 2000 feet/610 m) and thermal-imaging (2000 feet/610 m). Laser Targeting: an ultraviolet beam locks onto a target and ties into the other targeting systems, range 6000 feet (1828 m)."
  - name: "Antennae"
    description: "Two antennae (a third on ranking officers and leaders) act as motion and heat detectors and as feelers that move independently. The penalty for being blind is only -3 to strike, parry and dodge. They sense any attack from behind (normal parry or dodge apply), how many people are behind and to her side within a 20 foot (6.1 m) radius and whether any move toward her, and air temperature or sudden changes within 1D4 degrees, the source of heat or cold, wind speed, humidity, altitude and rate of speed via transport."
  - name: "Speech"
    description: "A soft, human-sounding feminine voice. Speaks, understands and reads the common languages and 30 pre-Rifts languages (American, Latin, Spanish, Portuguese, Italian, French, Swiss, German, Dutch, Polish, Russian, Euro, Chinese and Japanese among others) at 92%. Speaks but cannot read Dragonese at 98% and Splugorth at 80%. In public they speak broken American (50% to 65%) as part of the cover story."
  - name: "Self-Destruct Program"
    description: "To pass as a living creature she does not explode when all main body M.D.C. is destroyed; instead the internal systems burn and melt in a contained plasma blast, leaving a dark green ooze like melted plastic."
special_abilities:
  - name: "Critical strike and ranged bonuses"
    description: "Critical strike on a natural roll of 19 or 20. +6 to strike using the Shemarrian rail gun; +4 to strike with most other ranged weapons."
  - name: "Shemarrian Rail Gun"
    description: "An electro-magnetic mass driver like the Glitter Boy''s Boom Gun but built for accuracy, with a suppressor that lessens recoil and muffles the sonic boom (the report is like a shotgun). Fires a single flechette cartridge that bursts into hundreds of armor-piercing shards. Primary purpose: assault and anti-armor. Weight: gun 128 lbs (57.6 kg), belt 30 lbs (13.5 kg). Mega-Damage: 2D6x10 M.D. per round. Rate of fire: each round fired is one melee attack. Range: 6000 feet (1828 m). Payload: 12 in the gun, reloaded by hand at 1D4+3 per melee round, or belt fed from an 820 round ammo drum (390 lbs/175 kg). Special bonus: built-in sensor, computer-guided sight and laser targeting give +2 to strike with this weapon. Black Market cost: not available. The gun is linked to its owner and explodes when she is destroyed or when anyone but a Shemarrian, Archie, Hagan or an Archie ''Bot tampers with it: 5D6 M.D. to anyone within five feet (1.5 m), and the inside and half the rest of the weapon is vaporized."
